<title>TURKMENISTAN: Turkmen Apr electricity output down 4.6 pct on March.</title>
<headline>Turkmen Apr electricity output down 4.6 pct on March.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGABAT 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkmenistan's production of electricity fell by 4.6 percent in April on March and comprised 810 million kilowatt-hours, a report from the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    TURKMEN ELECTRICITY OUTPUT   Apr '97   Mar '97   Jan-Apr '97</p>
<p>    Million kilowatt-hours	  810.0     849.0	3,169</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change	-4.6     +18.7	n/a</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	   n/a	 n/a	-32.5</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
